description 22 has the description "Amendment of Directive (EU) 2022/2555 (NIS2): ·(1): Inserting Article 23a on the development and maintenance of a single-entry point for incident reporting; ·(3): Amending Article 23(4) to mandate the use of the single-entry point for notifications of severe incidents; ·(4): Inserting Article 23(12), which ensures that severe incidents are reported only once (either under NIS2, or under the Cyber Resilience Act); ·(5): Amending Article 30(1) ensuring that the single-entry point can be used, on a voluntary basis, for notifications by different entities.".

